  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Angler
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 17
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Erase / Lock-on
    AbilityDescription: 'LT, held: a narrow beam from the nose unpaints prisms (an already-ordered one leaves every order). Point it at a rival vessel and the picked squad LOCKS ON: it hunts that hull, and each bite is a scored contact Strike that takes petals, until you throw a new paint, lock another vessel, or the hunters die. R_VesselActions/ANGLER.md.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Lure, Tame & Grow
    AbilityDescription: 'X, held: the esca lights ahead of the nose and the hull slows. Wild herbivores in its reach turn to it, and one held in the light for the taming time joins your school. While the light is out, plants of your domain grow within the same reach.'
    Input: 8
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Steal Fauna
    UpgradeDescription: 'The lure takes creatures from other holders too: another Angler''s tamed fauna can be lured, tamed and kept. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Mass).'
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Paint
    AbilityDescription: 'RT, held: a beam reaching 3200 u (and close up, at the nose) paints prisms, which light up, and every creature prefers them; the picked squad balls up ahead. Let go: each creature flies at the most recently painted prisms first, at any distance, and eats them. Lit prisms stay lit until eaten or erased.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Paint Shields
    UpgradeDescription: 'The brush paints shielded prisms too, and the squad cracks a painted prism''s shield off when it arrives, so it can be eaten. Gated on IsUpgradeActive(Space).'
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Dash to the School
    AbilityDescription: 'Y (F on a keyboard): the hull dashes 75% of the way to the centre of every creature it leads, measured when pressed, in 0.35 s.'
    Input: 14
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
